# Harbor safety

## Read-only default

List projects, repos, and artifacts are fine when Harbor work is authorized.
Do **not**:

- delete an artifact, tag, repository, or project
- run retention that purges tags the user did not name
- create/reveal robot account tokens into chat
- broaden project member roles or public visibility

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

Prefer artifact/tag delete over project wipe. Never paste robot secrets or
admin passwords into chat.
